            <ArticleTitle>Developments in the field of clinical allergy in 2015 through the eyes of Clinical and Experimental Allergy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1389-1397</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/cea.12831</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the second of two papers, we describe developments in the field of clinical allergy as documented by Clinical and Experimental Allergy in 2015. Epidemiology, clinical allergy, asthma and rhinitis are all covered.</AbstractText>
